    "review.butterfly-iq.faq.2.answer.butterfly.iq.provides.diagnostic.quality.imaging.s": "Butterfly iQ provides diagnostic-quality imaging suitable for most point-of-care applications, though it doesn't match the absolute performance of high-end cart systems costing 10-100x more. The semiconductor technology and AI optimization deliver clinically useful images for FAST exams, cardiac assessments, vascular access, and routine diagnostic scanning. For specialized applications requiring maximum resolution or deep penetration, traditional systems may be preferred, but for 80% of clinical ultrasound use cases, Butterfly iQ provides excellent diagnostic quality.",
